(A bite for me too)

1024
00:38:31,150 --> 00:38:34,150
This is totally keto-friendly.

1025
00:38:35,080 --> 00:38:37,150
Come to think of it. Right?

1026
00:38:37,550 --> 00:38:39,760
There are no carbs. But it is so good.

1027
00:38:40,260 --> 00:38:42,160
The cheese makes it so smooth,

1028
00:38:42,460 --> 00:38:44,160
and I think everyone should eat it in one bite.

1029
00:38:45,030 --> 00:38:48,530
- Totally. - Wrapped up in the egg,

1030
00:38:48,600 --> 00:38:49,830
