1031
00:38:49,900 --> 00:38:52,070
- to get the flavor. - Totally.

1032
00:38:52,130 --> 00:38:53,400
How did you even come up with this idea?

1033
00:38:53,470 --> 00:38:55,440
I think I get what Hanbin meant...

1034
00:38:55,500 --> 00:38:56,740
about the sauce not being overwhelming.

1035
00:38:56,870 --> 00:38:59,510
The ketchup and mayo feel...

1036
00:38:59,580 --> 00:39:00,740
