1125
00:42:25,750 --> 00:42:26,750
Awesome.

1126
00:42:28,150 --> 00:42:30,420
Tsuki, please hang up the Spicy Pork and Bean Sprout Tonpeiyaki...

1127
00:42:30,490 --> 00:42:32,860
and Mitarashi Dango Skewer.

1128
00:42:33,160 --> 00:42:34,160
Here I go.

1129
00:42:35,590 --> 00:42:38,190
(Recipes that made our hearts pound from their visual appeal alone)

1130
00:42:38,260 --> 00:42:40,160
They say "WORK" is playing as BGM now.

1131
00:42:41,430 --> 00:42:43,370
Work, work, work, work

1132
00:42:43,770 --> 00:42:45,770
Pose. Strike a pretty pose, Tsuki.

1133
00:42:46,270 --> 00:42:47,870
(Idol pose, yay)

1134
00:42:47,870 --> 00:42:50,670
(Tsuki is on another level.)

1135
00:42:50,670 --> 00:42:51,770
Nice, nice, nice, nice.

1136
00:42:51,970 --> 00:42:54,140
(Third recipe is on the list of Hall of Fame.)

1137
00:42:54,440 --> 00:42:57,310
Well, we explored lots of Street Food from various countries today,

1138
00:42:57,310 --> 00:43:00,220
