1139
00:43:00,220 --> 00:43:02,220
Hanbin, how was it for you today?

1140
00:43:02,280 --> 00:43:04,520
- Our new family member. - First of all,

1141
00:43:04,590 --> 00:43:07,090
thank you so much for having me as the first guest.

1142
00:43:07,760 --> 00:43:10,060
- I truly enjoyed the food. - Thank you for saying so.

1143
00:43:10,560 --> 00:43:13,160
I'm grateful that everyone enjoyed my dishes.

1144
00:43:13,530 --> 00:43:15,030
- It really was delicious, honestly. - Right?

1145
00:43:15,030 --> 00:43:18,970
- It was so good. - I feel so proud,

1146
00:43:19,070 --> 00:43:22,470
and I hope everyone tries making it. Because it is really delicious.

1147
00:43:22,470 --> 00:43:23,910
(Please trust me.)

1148
00:43:25,070 --> 00:43:27,440
It is only the second episode, but it is so fun.

1149
00:43:27,540 --> 00:43:29,040
Totally. It makes me look forward...

1150
00:43:29,550 --> 00:43:30,950
- to what is coming next. - Right.

1151
00:43:32,050 --> 00:43:35,650
Doing this show up until now, I was thinking...

1152
00:43:35,650 --> 00:43:37,490
(Jaemin's comment which makes everyone nervous)

1153
00:43:37,890 --> 00:43:40,360
What if we split into teams later and have a battle?

1154
00:43:40,490 --> 00:43:42,260
(Notifying about a future cooking battle?)

1155
00:43:42,260 --> 00:43:43,860
