1157
00:43:45,090 --> 00:43:47,160
- A cooking battle? - Let us go right now.

1158
00:43:47,230 --> 00:43:49,530
- Bring it on? Bring it on? - Let us go right now.

1159
00:43:49,600 --> 00:43:50,670
- Step in? - Wait.

1160
00:43:50,670 --> 00:43:51,730
Weren't you two teammates?

1161
00:43:51,800 --> 00:43:52,940
(That was then, and a battle is a battle.)

1162
00:43:53,000 --> 00:43:54,000
Why are you touching here?

1163
00:43:54,270 --> 00:43:55,270
(Too funny)

1164
00:43:55,570 --> 00:43:56,570
(Dream Family full of love)

1165
00:43:56,670 --> 00:44:01,640
All right, we will be back next week with even more delicious stories.

1166
00:44:01,840 --> 00:44:03,050
This was IDOL'S TABLE.

1167
00:44:04,250 --> 00:44:05,550
Thanks for the meal today.

1168
00:44:05,550 --> 00:44:06,550
Oh, yeah!

1169
00:44:07,550 --> 00:44:09,120
People who are genuinely passionate about food.

1170
00:44:09,250 --> 00:44:10,650
- Hello. - Hello.

1171
00:44:10,950 --> 00:44:12,450
I am serious about eating.

1172
00:44:12,520 --> 00:44:14,060
I eat a lot. I think I can eat about five meals.

1173
00:44:14,220 --> 00:44:17,160
