1174
00:44:18,060 --> 00:44:19,260
I can eat that much, too.

1175
00:44:19,460 --> 00:44:22,360
When eating Som tam, ten chilies are standard for BamBam.

1176
00:44:22,360 --> 00:44:23,370
(Ten chilies?)

1177
00:44:23,370 --> 00:44:25,070
I can handle Chinese spicy food really well too.

1178
00:44:25,270 --> 00:44:26,640
I have got that stubborn streak,

1179
00:44:26,700 --> 00:44:28,470
