1180
00:44:28,600 --> 00:44:29,840
Is this "Show Me The Money" or what?

1181
00:44:29,940 --> 00:44:31,040
Bring out the capsaicin.

1182
00:44:32,340 --> 00:44:33,910
Here's the family member...

1183
00:44:33,980 --> 00:44:35,240
