1186
00:44:38,650 --> 00:44:40,150
Cooking is all about confidence.

1187
00:44:40,550 --> 00:44:42,380
This is right, isn't it? It's not that bad.

1188
00:44:42,450 --> 00:44:43,520
The way she's chopping is terrifying.

1189
00:44:45,050 --> 00:44:46,120
Will I get to eat this...

1190
00:44:46,120 --> 00:44:47,190
- sometime today? - I don't know.

1191
00:44:47,660 --> 00:44:49,020
Minnie made it, so it should be made in...

1192
00:44:49,090 --> 00:44:51,160
- Minnie's way. - Will it be delicious, right?

1193
00:44:51,360 --> 00:44:53,960
Bring in Minnie's spicy dish.

1194
00:44:55,060 --> 00:44:56,070
(Real reactions)

1195
00:44:56,170 --> 00:44:57,970
It looks insane.

1196
00:44:58,030 --> 00:45:00,040
(Minnie's red flavor will be revealed at the next table.)
